  "usage_note": "**Up** with no noun after it (*Stand up*, *Look up*) is an adverb, and **up** meaning *out of bed* or *finished* (*Are you up yet?*, *Time's up*) is an adjective; this entry covers only the preposition. Phrasal verbs such as **give up**, **get up**, and **pick up** have their own entries.",
